+
+Use a new synthetic installation with owner name **Demo Owner**, ledger currency **AED**, no personal institution names or identifiers. Capture at 1440×1000, browser zoom 100%, after loading settles. Do not show developer tools, .env, account passwords, filesystem usernames or download paths. These are instructions, not completed screenshot evidence.
